# Local chatbot knowledge

Restore these eight text files here before running `python backend/index.py`:

- diabetes.txt
- diabetes_types.txt
- heart_disease.txt
- general_health.txt
- foods.txt
- indian_diet.txt
- south_indian_diabetes_diet.txt
- heart_diet_indian.txt

`chunk.txt.example` shows the parser format using placeholder content.
The indexer reads the eight filenames above; it does not read `.example` files.
Replace placeholders with reviewed content and accurate source attribution in
the real `.txt` files before indexing. Real knowledge files remain local.
